</style>
  <!-- «TBD-VERIFY-HOURS»: Hours shown as 7:00–17:00 PT — live page historically said 6AM–5PM. James confirms at preview review. -->
  <!-- glow orb -->
  <div class="glow-orb" style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(247,82,82,.13) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;will-change:transform;"></div>

<main style="position: relative; z-index: 1;"><div style="height: 54px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgb(210, 210, 215); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">Live site header mounts here — do not redesign</div><section data-screen-label="Returns hero" style="padding: 56px 24px 88px;">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto;">
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); margin: 0px 0px 40px;"><a class="scp0" href="/support/" style="color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">Support</a> › <span style="color: rgb(29, 29, 31);">Returns &amp; Exchanges</span></p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: start;">
<div>
<p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">Returns &amp; Exchanges</p>
<h1 style="font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; margin: 0px 0px 20px;">Something not working? We'll make it right.</h1>
<p style="font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 24px); color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.45; margin: 0px 0px 32px;">Submit a Return Material Authorization (RMA) request in under 3 minutes. Most claims get a reply within a couple of business days, and every fixture is backed by our written Limited Warranty.</p>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 36px;">
<a class="scp1" href="#" style="background: rgb(243, 39, 64); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 980px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.2s;">Start an RMA request →</a>
<a class="scp2" href="#" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(29, 29, 31);">Sign in to track existing RMA</a>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
<div style="background: rgb(245, 245, 247); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;"><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Up to 10-yr</div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115);">Limited warranty · 100,000 hrs</div></div>
<div style="background: rgb(245, 245, 247); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;"><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">LaborShield™</div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115);">Optional labor coverage</div></div>
<div style="background: rgb(245, 245, 247); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;"><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Photo-first</div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115);">Most claims · usually no return shipping</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="background: rgb(245, 245, 247); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px;">
<p style="font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); margin: 0px 0px 12px;">Existing customer</p>
<h3 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">Track your RMAs in the Customer Portal</h3>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px 0px 20px;">Claim status, replacement tracking, and history in one place. We never share claim data outside your account.</p>
<a class="scp3" href="#" style="display: block; text-align: center; background: rgb(29, 29, 31); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 12px; border-radius: 980px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Sign in</a>
<div style="display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px;">
<a class="scp0" href="mailto:warranty@archipelagolighting.com?subject=Portal access" style="color: rgb(66, 66, 69);">→ Request portal access</a>
<a class="scp0" href="#" style="color: rgb(66, 66, 69);">→ Forgot password</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 229, 231) rgb(229, 229, 231) rgb(229, 229, 231) rgb(29, 29, 31); border-image: initial; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-top: 40px;">
<p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(66, 66, 69); margin: 0px;"><span style="font-weight: 600; color: rgb(29, 29, 31);">If it's a safety issue</span> — Fire, smoke, melting, or anything falling from a fixture — call <span style="font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;">(866) 912-3220</span> directly. Our Operations team takes safety claims off the queue immediately, before any form.</p>
</div>
</div></section><section data-screen-label="What to expect" style="padding: 96px 24px; background: rgb(245, 245, 247);">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto;">
<h2 style="font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 0px 0px 48px; max-width: 860px;">From submission to replacement — what to expect.</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
<div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgb(210, 210, 215); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 0 0 auto;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M12 16V5M8 8.5L12 4.5l4 4"></path><path d="M5 19h14"></path></svg></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; height: 1px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231);"></div><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">01</span></div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">You submit</h3><p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0px;">Form plus evidence — 3 photos minimum, about 3 minutes. Logged in ALG Records the same business day.</p></div>
<div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgb(210, 210, 215); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 0 0 auto;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6"></circle><path d="M15 15l5.5 5.5"></path></svg></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; height: 1px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231);"></div><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">02</span></div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">We review</h3><p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0px;">A warranty tech validates the claim itself — SKU, date code, PO, and coverage tier against the written warranty terms.</p></div>
<div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgb(210, 210, 215); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 0 0 auto;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M4 7.5h4l1.5-2.5h5L16 7.5h4v11H4z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12.5" r="3.2"></circle></svg></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; height: 1px; background: rgb(229, 229, 231);"></div><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">03</span></div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">Evidence review</h3><p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0px;">Your photos stand in for the fixture. Most claims clear on evidence alone — no physical return required.</p></div>
<div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgb(210, 210, 215); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: 0 0 auto;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M2 7h11v9H2zM13 10h4.5L20 13v3h-2.5"></path><circle cx="6.5" cy="17" r="1.7"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="17" r="1.7"></circle></svg></div><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">04</span></div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">Replacement ships</h3><p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0px;">About 5 business days when in stock; cross-warehouse transfers are covered.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section><section data-screen-label="What to have ready" style="padding: 96px 24px;">
<div style="max-width: 980px; margin: 0px auto;">
<p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); margin: 0px 0px 14px;">RMA Policy — Current</p>
<h2 style="font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 0px 0px 12px;">What to have ready before you start.</h2>
<p style="font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 22px); color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.45; margin: 0px 0px 40px;">Four things — every field is one we genuinely need to issue the RMA. No marketing questions.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-2-1.5L14 21l-2-1.5L10 21l-2-1.5L6 21z"></path><path d="M9 8h6M9 11.5h6"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">1</span></div><p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px;">ALG PO# or Invoice#</p></div>
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 6v12M7.5 6v12M10.5 6v8M14 6v12M17 6v9M20 6v12"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">2</span></div><p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px;">Product SKU and date code</p></div>
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 7.5h4l1.5-2.5h5L16 7.5h4v11H4z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12.5" r="3.2"></circle></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">3</span></div><p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 4px;">3+ photos of the failure</p><p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px;">Full view · close-up · label with SKU + date code</p></div>
<div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="#86868B" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-5.2-6.5-10a6.5 6.5 0 0113 0c0 4.8-6.5 10-6.5 10z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10.7" r="2.2"></circle></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(134, 134, 139);">4</span></div><p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px;">Site address and install date</p></div>
</div>
</div></section><section data-screen-label="Returns FAQ" style="padding: 96px 24px; background: rgb(245, 245, 247);">
<div style="max-width: 980px; margin: 0px auto;">
<h2 style="font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 0px 0px 12px;">Frequently asked.</h2>
<p style="font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 22px); color: rgb(110, 110, 115); line-height: 1.45; margin: 0px 0px 40px;">Common questions from contractors and distributors.</p>
<div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 16px; padding: 8px 28px;">
<div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231);">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0px; cursor: pointer;"><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;">How long do I have to submit a claim?</span><span style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="sc-interp">−</span></span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(66, 66, 69); padding: 0px 24px 24px 0px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px;">Freight damage: within 3 days of receipt. Defects: any time within the warranty term — <span style="font-weight: 600;">PRO+ 10 years, PRO 7 years, ECO 5 years</span>; linear lamps 7 years, decorative 3 years, sensors 3–5 years.</p><p style="margin: 0px;">Emergency and life-safety fixtures carry split coverage: <span style="font-weight: 600;">5 years electronics / 1 year battery</span>. Coverage starts at install, or 90 days after purchase, whichever comes first.</p></div>
</div>
<div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231);">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0px; cursor: pointer;"><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;">Do I have to physically return the unit?</span><span style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="sc-interp">+</span></span></div>
</div>
<div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231);">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0px; cursor: pointer;"><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;">Who pays freight?</span><span style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="sc-interp">+</span></span></div>
</div>
<div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 231);">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0px; cursor: pointer;"><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;">What's LaborShield?</span><span style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="sc-interp">+</span></span></div>
</div>
<div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0px; cursor: pointer;"><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;">How fast will I hear back?</span><span style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(134, 134, 139); flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="sc-interp">+</span></span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;">
